  "name": "Sun & Moon Trainer Kit: Alolan Sandslash & Alolan Ninetales",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "The second Sun & Moon Trainer Kit, released on 1 June 2018, with two half decks led by the promos Alolan Sandslash SM127 and Alolan Ninetales SM128, two booklets that guide the players through a game, a playmat, damage counters, status markers, a coin and a code card for the Pokémon Trading Card Game Online. Each half deck held a non-holo and a water web holofoil copy of its Pokémon, marked in the bottom right corner with a numbered circle: gray for Sandslash, numbered 16 and 30, and blue for Ninetales, numbered 17 and 30.",
